{
  "audio": "002.the-missing-variable.mp3",
  "paragraph": 2,
  "text": "The missing variable is the harness. An AI agent is never just a model; an agent equals the model plus the harness wrapped around it. Think of a raw language model like a brilliant CPU sitting on a desk with no operating system. It can reason about code all day, yet by itself it cannot read a file, run a test, manage working memory, or verify whether its own answer actually works. The harness is the operating system that turns raw intelligence into reliable software.",
